{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-02", "pageid": 101212, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-01\" title=\"间隔月-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-03\" title=\"间隔月-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BA.B2.E5.AF.86.E6.9C.8B.E5.8F.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"亲密朋友\">亲密朋友</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 亲密朋友</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Close Friend</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六当然没忘记眼前的同事。正式加入拉普拉斯科算中心的时候，还是对方带着她签的合同。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>这是合同，制式条款，但也推荐仔细阅读。冷周六研究员……种族是梅露西娜是吗？很罕见的血统。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我父母告诉我这是梅露西娜血统，虽然我经常觉得遗传表现要更接近“美杜莎”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但我决定接受他们的说辞。毕竟在我自己能填表之前，他们已经帮我填过很多次了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我也觉得梅露西娜比美杜莎可爱一点儿。传说梅露西娜每周六都会变成蛇，或许是冷周六这个代号的词源？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“冷周六”：</div><div>您听说过这个传说？是哪个版本？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>当然，版本在文学讨论中总是很重要。传闻水泽仙女普列西娜与人类国王结为夫妇，婚前要求国王绝不能观看她分娩的过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>好奇的国王违背了誓约，普利西娜就消失不见，只留下了包括梅露西娜在内的三个女儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>这三个可怜的女孩儿决心报复父亲，却因此被母亲诅咒，每到星期六就会变成蛇身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>接着普列西娜的长女梅露西娜也爱上了人类，她许诺给人类丈夫城堡和财富，唯独要求对方每周六不能与她见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“冷周六”：</div><div>众所周知，每当故事中出现这样的誓约时，离背誓的出现也就不远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>毋庸置疑，毕竟俗套的故事总是如此相似！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>但这不妨碍这个故事被这样解读——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>当人类固执地突破“界限”窥探“不允许被探知的秘密”，就会遭遇超自然的惩罚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>枯燥乏味，但很符合那个年代主题的故事内核。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿！要我说，这样的解读也太过人类中心主义了吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>谁在……说话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然插入的第二个声音让她有些迷茫，但紧接着第三个也响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>在这里签字就可以了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>太神奇了，这条小蛇……难道具有独立意识吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>很高兴我的兄弟姐妹们没有吓到你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>所以，我签咯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>……噢，是的，是的。在这里，第七页，还有最后一页，都要签名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>第七页？好的，稍等我一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>真是不可思议的种族！总之，再次自我介绍一下，你可以叫我绿棱镜，我是你的同事和项目负责人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>难得有人文素养这么高的同事加入我们的研究项目，这在拉普拉斯可比科研天才更难得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>很高兴你喜欢，有人文素养的其实是她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一条小蛇从冷周六的袖口探出了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>你好，我是艾斯黛乐。我也很高兴认识你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我刚才在看合同，正好听你们聊得这么投缘，就没有打扰你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>实在是太抱歉了，艾斯黛乐，我没想到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>项目负责人眨了眨眼睛，重新快速浏览了一遍手里的新同事资料，试图重构认知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>所以，你们一共是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>九个，八蛇一人。我是一号，现在要入职的这个是二号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-311613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-311613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-311613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不准用编号叫我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>好的，当然。我们总会满足你的要求，小黄瓜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未曾预计的庞大蛇口显然让绿棱镜有些适应不良，幸好没有任何蛇会因为旁人的适应性问题感到困扰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿，别转移话题。我刚才在说什么来着，人类中心主义视角！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>怎么就从来没人能站在梅露西娜的角度思考问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>可能是因为梅露西娜不写论文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六不得不为自己和自己的成果发声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我就写过很多论文，还都发表了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>好吧，好吧。梅露西娜或许会写空间材料学论文，但至少不写文学分析。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>这可不一定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>谁知道呢？……也许梅露西娜以后还会写航天领域的论文。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>还是你好，艾斯黛乐，我的甜心宝贝小南瓜。不像某些蛇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>或许我应该自我介绍一下吗？冷周六研究员，你在拉普拉斯总部加入的蛇纹石石棉隔热应用专项……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>具体的研究项目像一块饱蘸清洁剂的海绵，揩净了记忆玻璃上所有模糊之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢——我想起来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>绿棱镜，我怎么可能忘了你——再没有比你的神秘学能力更适合材料性能测试的了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>天知道我来了这里之后有多怀念你，我还经常跟指针提起你呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你们当时说要进行的试验进展怎么样了？一直没看到新的论文，我正想写信问问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一连串流利的问候洋溢着亲切和熟悉，让屋里所有人都渐渐面露震惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我冷酷的小黄瓜，如果你不是因为我的神秘学能力才记得我，我会更高兴些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这是我能给出的最高赞誉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在可悲的大人们即将再次偏离应有的话题走向时，终于有人决定站出来结束这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我想，绿棱镜小姐到普列谢茨克分部来，一定是有什么重要的事吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>噢，当然，重要的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的，你最近有没有换个新研究项目的打算？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-02"}}